# custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 依頼されたベンチャーが実行できなくなったため、<br>依頼をキャンセルします。
#. de: Die Unternehmung ist zurzeit nicht möglich. Der Auftrag wird abgebrochen.
#. fr: La tâche confiée ne pouvant plus être accomplie, le jeton va vous être rendu et la demande faite au servant sera annulée.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_INACTIVE_TASK_ABORT:1"
msgid "The assigned venture will be abandoned as it is no longer available."
msgstr "Поручение отменено: выполнить это приключение больше нельзя."

#. ja: このリテイナーはクラスが設定されていないため、<br><sheet Item $n1 0>を渡すことができません。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> kann nicht verwendet werden. Du musst deinen Gehilfen erst einen Job zuweisen.
#. fr: Aucune classe n'ayant été attribuée à ce servant, vous ne pouvez pas lui donner <noun-fr Item 6 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_LVUP_NO_CLASS:1"
msgid "Unable to use <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>. You must first assign a class for your retainer."
msgstr "Предмет <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> нельзя использовать. Сначала выберите класс для своего ретейнера."

#. ja: このリテイナーは、すでにレベル<num $n2>に達しているため、<br><sheet Item $n1 0>を渡すことができません。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> kann nicht verwendet werden. Dein Gehilfe hat bereits Stufe <num $n2> erreicht.
#. fr: Le servant ayant déjà atteint le niveau <num $n2>, vous ne pouvez pas lui donner <noun-fr Item 6 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_LVUP_NO_EFFECT:1"
msgid "Unable to use <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>. Your retainer has already attained level <num $n2>."
msgstr "Предмет <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> нельзя использовать. Ваш ретейнер уже достиг <num $n2>-го уровня."

#. ja: リテイナーは、雇用主のレベルを上回ることはできません。
#. de: Die Stufe deines Gehilfen kann nicht über deine eigene steigen.
#. fr: Le niveau d'un servant ne peut dépasser celui de son maître dans sa classe ou son job actuel.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_LVUP_CAP_PLAYER:1"
msgid "Your retainer cannot exceed your own level."
msgstr "Уровень вашего ретейнера не может быть выше вашего."

#. ja: このリテイナーは、雇用主のレベルと同じ、<br>レベル<num $n1>までしかレベルアップできません。<br>よろしいですか？
#. de: Die Stufe deines Gehilfen kann nur bis Stufe <num $n1> (deine eigene Stufe) gesteigert werden. Fortfahren?
#. fr: Le servant ne peut pas dépasser le niveau <num $n1>, celui de son maître. Confirmer<nbsp>?
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_ASK_PLAYER_LVSYNC:1"
msgid "You can only advance your retainer as far as level <num $n1>, to match your current level. Do you wish to proceed?"
msgstr "Ретейнер сможет поднять уровень только до <num $n1>, как у вас сейчас. Продолжить?"

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」がありません。
#. de: Du besitzt <noun-de Item 4 $n1 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Vous ne possédez pas <noun-fr Item 8 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_LVUP_NO_ITEM:1"
msgid "You do not have <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> in your possession."
msgstr "У вас нет <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: 本当にこのリテイナーに「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を渡しますか？
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1></capitalize> deinem Gehilfen geben?
#. fr: Voulez-vous vraiment donner <noun-fr Item 6 $n1 1 1> au servant<nbsp>?
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_ASK_USE_LVUP_ITEM:1"
msgid "Give <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> to your retainer?"
msgstr "Передать ретейнеру <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>?"

#. ja: リテイナーをレベル<num $n1>にする
#. de: Stufe des Gehilfen auf <num $n1> steigern
#. fr: Faire passer le servant au niveau <num $n1>
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_ASK_USE_LVUP_ITEM_CHECK:1"
msgid "Advance retainer to level <num $n1>."
msgstr "Поднять уровень ретейнера до <num $n1>."

#. ja: リテイナーを雇用する権利がないため、<br>呼び出すことができません。
#. de: Du kannst noch keinen Gehilfen anstellen und daher auch keinen herbeirufen.
#. fr: Vous n'avez pas encore obtenu l'au<shy>to<shy>ri<shy>sa<shy>tion d'engager des servants.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_DEFAULT_TALK:1"
msgid "You have not yet received approval to hire retainers."
msgstr "Вам ещё не разрешили нанимать ретейнеров."

#. ja: リテイナーを雇っていないため、呼び出せません。
#. de: Du kannst keinen Gehilfen rufen, weil du noch keinen angestellt hast.
#. fr: Vous n'avez pas de servant à votre service.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_NO_RETAINERS_AVAILABLE:1"
msgid "You have not yet hired a retainer."
msgstr "Вы ещё не наняли ретейнера."

#. ja: リテイナーを呼び出すことができませんでした。
#. de: Der Gehilfe konnte nicht herbeigerufen werden.
#. fr: Impossible d'appeler le servant.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_CALL_RETAINER_FAILED:1"
msgid "Your retainer did not respond."
msgstr "Не удалось вызвать ретейнера."

#. ja: 今はまだ利用できないようだ……。
#. de: Diese Funktion steht dir noch nicht zur Verfügung.
#. fr: La sonnette semble ne pas fonctionner...
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_DISABLE_RETAINER_BELL:1"
msgid "The bell does not seem to be functioning..."
msgstr "Похоже, звонок пока не работает..."

#. ja: 契約切れのリテイナーを呼び出すことはできません。
#. de: Du kannst den Gehilfen nicht rufen, weil der Vertrag abgelaufen ist.
#. fr: Action impossible. Le servant a été renvoyé ou son abonnement est terminé.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_CALL_FAILED_NO_CHARGE:1"
msgid "You cannot summon that retainer unless you resume payment for their services."
msgstr "Нельзя вызвать ретейнера, пока вы не возобновите оплату его услуг."

#. ja: リテイナーの装備品をすべてはずさないと、<br>リテイナーのクラス・ジョブはリセットできません。
#. de: Du kannst die Klasse bzw. den Job des Gehilfen erst wechseln, wenn er alle Aus<shy>rüstungs<shy>gegen<shy>stände abgelegt hat.
#. fr: Il est nécessaire d'enlever tous les équipements du servant pour réinitialiser sa classe ou son job.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_RESET_ERROR_EQUIPMENT:1"
msgid "You cannot change your retainer's class/job until all gear has been removed."
msgstr "Сначала снимите с ретейнера всё снаряжение. Только после этого можно сменить ему класс или профессию."

#. ja: 依頼中のリテイナーベンチャーはありません。
#. de: Du hast deinen Gehilfen momentan nicht mit einer Unternehmung betraut.
#. fr: Aucune tâche n'est en cours.
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_NO_CURRENT_TASK:1"
msgid "Your retainer has not been assigned a venture."
msgstr "Ретейнеру не поручено ни одно приключение."

#. ja: リテイナーのメニューに、<br>「リテイナーのジョブ設定」が追加されました。<br>「リテイナーのジョブ設定」を選んで内容を確認してみましょう。
#. de: Du kannst deinem Gehilfen nun über das Menü einen Job zuweisen.
#. fr: L'option “Attribuer un job au servant” a été ajoutée au menu. Sélectionnez-la pour voir comment elle fonctionne.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_RECOMMEND_JOB_CHANGE:1"
msgid "Your retainer is qualified to be trained in more advanced traditions. Select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Assign retainer a job</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to proceed."
msgstr "Ваш ретейнер готов освоить более сложную науку. Выберите <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Назначить слуге профессию</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: リテイナーに対してジョブの設定を行いたい場合は、<br>「リテイナーのジョブ設定」を選択してください。
#. de: Wähle dazu „Job festlegen“.
#. fr: Si vous désirez attribuer un job à un servant, appelez-le et choisissez l'option “Attribuer un job au servant” dans le menu.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_SUGGEST_JOB_CHANGE:1"
msgid "To train your retainer in a more advanced tradition, select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Assign retainer a job</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to proceed."
msgstr "Чтобы обучить ретейнера более сложной науке, выберите <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Назначить слуге профессию</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: リテイナーにジョブの知識を伝授するには、<br>各都市のマーケットにいるリテイナー雇用窓口から、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を入手し、所持品に入れる必要があります。
#. de: Um einem Gehilfen dein Wissen über einen Job zu vermitteln, musst du am Gehilfen<shy>schalter zuerst <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> erwerben.
#. fr: Pour attribuer un job à un servant, vous devez d'abord acheter <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1> auprès du comptoir d'emploi des servants d'une des cités et l'avoir dans votre inventaire.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_SUGGEST_JOB_SCROLL:1"
msgid "To assign your retainer a job, you must purchase <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> from a retainer vocate and have it in your inventory."
msgstr "Чтобы назначить ретейнеру профессию, купите <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> у вербовщика ретейнеров на рынке одного из городов и положите её в инвентарь."

#. ja: リテイナーに<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>の知識を伝授するには、<br>リテイナーの装備を、すべて外す必要があります。
#. de: Der Gehilfe muss zuerst seine Ausrüstung ablegen.
#. fr: Pour attribuer le job “<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>” au servant, vous devez d'abord enlever tout l'équipement qu'il porte.
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_JOB_ERROR_EQUIPMENT:1"
msgid "You cannot assign your retainer the <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> job until all gear has been removed."
msgstr "Чтобы назначить ретейнеру профессию <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>, сначала снимите с него всё снаряжение."

#. ja: リテイナーに<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>の知識を伝授するには、<br>リテイナーのレベルが<num $n2>以上になっている必要があります。
#. de: Der Gehilfe muss mindestens Stufe <num $n2> erreicht haben.
#. fr: Le servant doit être de niveau <num $n2> ou plus afin que vous puissiez lui attribuer le job “<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>”.
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_JOB_ERROR_NEED_RETAINER_LEVEL:1"
msgid "You cannot assign your retainer the <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> job until they have achieved level <num $n2>."
msgstr "Чтобы назначить ретейнеру профессию <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>, он должен достичь как минимум <num $n2>-го уровня."

#. ja: リテイナーに<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>の知識を伝授するには、<br>プレイヤーの<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>のレベルが<br><num $n2>以上になっている必要があります。
#. de: Du musst mindestens Stufe <num $n2> als <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> erreicht haben.
#. fr: Vous devez être de niveau <num $n2> en <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> afin d'attribuer ce job au servant.
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 14 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n1 0></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 26 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n1 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 33 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_JOB_ERROR_NEED_PLAYER_LEVEL:1"
msgid "You cannot assign your retainer the <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> job until you achieve level <num $n2> as <if ($n1 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n1 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr "Чтобы назначить ретейнеру профессию <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>, достигните <num $n2>-го уровня за <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>."

#. ja: リテイナーのレベルが、<br>プレイヤーの<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>のレベルよりも高いため、<br>リテイナーに<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>の知識を伝授できません。
#. de: Die gewünschte Aktion war nicht möglich, da die Stufe des Gehilfen als <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> höher als deine Stufe ist.
#. fr: Le niveau du servant étant supérieur à celui que votre personnage a en <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>, vous ne pouvez pas lui attribuer ce job.
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 14 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n1 0></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 26 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n1 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 33 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_JOB_ERROR_LOW_PLAYER_LEVEL:1"
msgid "You cannot assign your retainer the <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> job until you yourself achieve a higher level as <if ($n1 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $n1 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr "Чтобы назначить ретейнеру профессию <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>, вам нужно превзойти его уровень за <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>."

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」がありません。
#. de: Du musst zuerst <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> erwerben.
#. fr: Vous ne possédez pas de <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CmnDefRetainerBell_00544:TEXT_CMNDEFRETAINERBELL_00544_JOB_ERROR_NO_ITEM:1"
msgid "Unable to proceed. You do not have <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> in your possession."
msgstr "Нельзя продолжить. У вас нет <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: リテイナーが「<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>」の知識を受け継いだ！
#. de: Du hast dem Gehilfen erfolgreich dein Wissen als <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> vermittelt!
#. fr: Vous avez transmis la pratique du job “<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>” au servant<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $n1 0><else><if ($n1 == 33)>an <… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 14 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
